<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Hartebees Q1 pre-capex net profit dives.</title>
<headline>Hartebees Q1 pre-capex net profit dives.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quarter to end-March versus preceding quarter</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Gold profit		  20.02	     vs 101.35</p>
<p>    Capital spendng	    6.41	     vs  7.56</p>
